o<mapper-run> sub
(Shared executor. Parameters: mode, drop, grid, resolution, usable reach, reserve, side depth, side backoff.)
(Physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
o<mp_preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    o<mapper-run> return
o<mp_preview> endif
o<mp_spindle> if [#<_spindle_on> NE 0]
    (ABORT,Stop the spindle before using the XYZ probe. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<mp_spindle> endif
M66 P3 L0
o<mp_spindle_feedback> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,Spindle feedback reports running. Use Spindle Stop before Run; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<mp_spindle_feedback> endif
o<mp_rotation> if [#[5230 + [#5220 - 1] * 20] NE 0]
    (ABORT,Select an unrotated work frame for the mapper. The stock may be rotated. No offsets were changed.)
o<mp_rotation> endif
M70
G21 G90 G94 G17 G40 G80 G61.1
#<_mp_ox> = [#<_abs_x> - #<_x>]
#<_mp_oy> = [#<_abs_y> - #<_y>]
#<_mp_oz> = [#<_abs_z> - #<_z>]
#<_mp_clear> = #<_z>
#<_mp_floor> = [#<_z> - #2]
#<_mp_step_x> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]
#<_mp_step_y> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]
#<_mp_step_z> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_2]scale>]]
#<_mp_mode> = #1
#<_mp_sequence> = 0
#<_mp_sample> = 0
#<_mp_phase> = 0
#<_mp_edge> = -1
#<_mp_stage> = -1
M64 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<mp_selected> if [#5399 NE 1]
    (ABORT,XYZ probe selection was not reported. Abort then Pendant Mode; check its selection indication.)
o<mp_selected> endif
o<mp_initial_contact> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
    (ABORT,Probe is already touching. Use Pendant Mode to position clear above the block before Run.)
o<mp_initial_contact> endif
(Mode 4 uses the plan bound to this loaded program; other modes retain their normal planner.)
o<mp_followup_begin> if [#<_mp_mode> EQ 4]
    M190 P12 Q0
o<mp_followup_begin> else
    M190 P9 Q0
o<mp_followup_begin> endif
M66 P5 L0
(LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/mapper-request.txt)
(LOG,DMC2_MAPPER_RECORD_V1)
(LOG,sequence=0)
(LOG,kind=start)
(LOG,mode=%d#1)
(LOG,x=%.9f#<_x>)
(LOG,y=%.9f#<_y>)
(LOG,z=%.9f#<_z>)
(LOG,offset_x=%.9f#<_mp_ox>)
(LOG,offset_y=%.9f#<_mp_oy>)
(LOG,offset_z=%.9f#<_mp_oz>)
(LOG,x_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_x]min_limit>)
(LOG,x_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_x]max_limit>)
(LOG,y_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_y]min_limit>)
(LOG,y_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_y]max_limit>)
(LOG,z_min=%.9f#<_ini[axis_z]min_limit>)
(LOG,z_max=%.9f#<_ini[axis_z]max_limit>)
(LOG,drop=%.9f#2)
(LOG,grid=%.9f#3)
(LOG,resolution=%.9f#4)
(LOG,usable_reach=%.9f#5)
(LOG,reach_reserve=%.9f#6)
(LOG,side_depth=%.9f#7)
(LOG,backoff=%.9f#8)
#<step_x> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]
#<step_y> = [1 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]
(LOG,step_x=%.9f#<step_x>)
(LOG,step_y=%.9f#<step_y>)
(LOG,step_z=%.9f#<_mp_step_z>)
#<max_feed> = [#<_ini[traj]max_linear_velocity> * 60]
(LOG,max_feed=%.9f#<max_feed>)
(LOGCLOSE)
M190 P10 Q0
M66 P5 L0
#<_mp_sequence> = 1

o<mp_loop> while [1]
    M190 P11 Q#<_mp_sequence>
    M66 P5 L0
    o<mp_fresh> if [#<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-sequence]> NE #<_mp_sequence>]
        (ABORT,The mapper did not publish this capture sequence. No stale target was used. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mp_fresh> endif
    #<_mp_phase> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-phase]>
    #<_mp_sample> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-sample]>
    #<_mp_edge> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-edge]>
    #<_mp_ax> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-approach-x]>
    #<_mp_ay> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-approach-y]>
    #<tx> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-target-x]>
    #<ty> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-target-y]>
    #<tz> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-target-z]>
    #<_mp_coarse> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-coarse-feed]>
    #<_mp_downward> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-downward-feed]>
    #<_mp_fine> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-fine-feed]>
    #<_mp_travel> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-travel-feed]>
    #<_mp_backoff> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-backoff-mm]>
    #<_mp_x_min> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-x-min]>
    #<_mp_x_max> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-x-max]>
    #<_mp_y_min> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-y-min]>
    #<_mp_y_max> = #<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-y-max]>
    o<mp_still_fresh> if [#<_hal[axisui.mapper-plan-sequence]> NE #<_mp_sequence>]
        (ABORT,The mapper plan changed while being read. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
    o<mp_still_fresh> endif
    o<mp_finished> if [#<_mp_phase> EQ 5]
        o<mp_loop> break
    o<mp_finished> endif
    (Typed outline phases: 6 first edge, 7 local candidate, 8 radial withdrawal, 9 seam check.)
    #<outline_local> = [[#<_mp_phase> GE 6] AND [#<_mp_phase> LE 9]]
    o<mp_local_entry> if [[#<outline_local> EQ 1] AND [#<_mp_phase> NE 6]]
        o<mp_fixed_plane> if [[ABS[#<_z> - #<_mp_trace_z>] GT [#<_mp_step_z> / 2]] OR [ABS[#<tz> - #<_mp_trace_z>] GT [#<_mp_step_z> / 2]]]
            (ABORT,Outline trace differs from its retained Z plane. No new move issued; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<mp_fixed_plane> endif
        o<mp_seam_approach> if [#<_mp_phase> EQ 9]
            (Local seam approach at fixed Z: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
            o<mapper-move> call [#<_mp_ax>] [#<_mp_ay>] [#<tz>] [0] [#<_mp_coarse>]
        o<mp_seam_approach> else
            o<mp_local_origin> if [[ABS[#<_x> - #<_mp_ax>] GT [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_0]scale>]]] OR [ABS[#<_y> - #<_mp_ay>] GT [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_1]scale>]]]]
                (ABORT,Outline candidate does not start at the retained released endpoint. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
            o<mp_local_origin> endif
        o<mp_seam_approach> endif
        #<return_z> = #<_mp_trace_z>
    o<mp_local_entry> else
        o<mp_at_clearance> if [ABS[#<_z> - #<_mp_clear>] GT [#<_mp_step_z> / 2]]
            (ABORT,Probe is not at starting-Z clearance. No lateral transfer issued; Abort then Pendant Mode.)
        o<mp_at_clearance> endif
        (XY transfer at starting clearance: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<mapper-move> call [#<_mp_ax>] [#<_mp_ay>] [#<_mp_clear>] [0] [#<_mp_travel>]
        #<return_z> = #<_mp_clear>
        o<mp_side> if [[#<_mp_phase> EQ 4] OR [#<_mp_phase> EQ 6]]
            o<mp_trace_depth_floor> if [#<_mp_phase> EQ 6]
                (The Rust plan checked last top contact minus Trace depth against the retained reach and travel envelope.)
                #<_mp_floor> = #<tz>
            o<mp_trace_depth_floor> endif
            (Outside-edge descent holds XY at the retained target Z and downward search feed.)
            o<mapper-move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<tz>] [0] [#<_mp_downward>]
            #<return_z> = #<tz>
            o<mp_save_trace_z> if [#<_mp_phase> EQ 6]
                #<_mp_trace_z> = #<tz>
            o<mp_save_trace_z> endif
        o<mp_side> endif
    o<mp_local_entry> endif
    (Top -Z or inward side touch: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
    o<mapper-move> call [#<tx>] [#<ty>] [#<tz>] [2] [#<_mp_coarse>]
    o<mp_coarse_hit> if [#<_mp_hit> EQ 1]
        (Release along reverse approach. X: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<mp_full_coarse_backoff> if [#<outline_local> EQ 1]
            o<mapper-outline-backoff> call [#<tx>] [#<ty>] [#<tz>]
        o<mp_full_coarse_backoff> else
            o<mapper-move> call [#<_mp_ax>] [#<_mp_ay>] [#<return_z>] [1] [#<_mp_fine>]
        o<mp_full_coarse_backoff> endif
        (Same target, slow re-touch. X: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
        o<mapper-move> call [#<tx>] [#<ty>] [#<tz>] [3] [#<_mp_fine>]
    o<mp_coarse_hit> endif
    (Withdraw on the same normal before lifting: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
    o<mp_full_fine_backoff> if [#<outline_local> EQ 1]
        o<mp_fine_was_hit> if [#<_mp_hit> EQ 1]
            o<mapper-outline-backoff> call [#<tx>] [#<ty>] [#<tz>]
        o<mp_fine_was_hit> endif
    o<mp_full_fine_backoff> else
        o<mapper-move> call [#<_mp_ax>] [#<_mp_ay>] [#<return_z>] [1] [#<_mp_fine>]
    o<mp_full_fine_backoff> endif
    o<mp_return_policy> if [#<outline_local> EQ 0]
        #<withdraw_action> = 4
        o<mp_horizontal_backoff> if [#<_mp_phase> EQ 4]
            #<withdraw_action> = 0
        o<mp_horizontal_backoff> endif
        (Complete backoff: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X. Top backoff is UP / LinuxCNC +Z only.)
        o<mapper-move> call [#<_mp_ax>] [#<_mp_ay>] [#<return_z>] [#<withdraw_action>] [#<_mp_travel>]
        (Return UP / LinuxCNC +Z, XY unchanged; retain recontacts and continue upward.)
        o<mapper-move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_mp_clear>] [4] [#<_mp_travel>]
    o<mp_return_policy> endif
    o<mapper-record> call [4]
    (DEBUG,Mapper sample %d#<_mp_sample> retained; phase %d#<_mp_phase>. Next plan uses this released endpoint.)
o<mp_loop> endwhile
(After a closed outline, make the existing final UP / LinuxCNC +Z return once; XY unchanged.)
o<mp_outline_final> if [#<_mp_mode> EQ 2]
    o<mapper-move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_mp_clear>] [4] [#<_mp_travel>]
o<mp_outline_final> endif
M65 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<mp_release_selection> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,Scan ended but program probe selection remains active. Captures are retained. Abort then Pendant Mode.)
o<mp_release_selection> endif
o<mapper-record> call [6]
(DEBUG,Automatic scan ended at starting-Z clearance. Contacts and rough geometry are in tmp/output/mapper.)
M72
o<mapper-run> endsub
M2
